<div class="page">

  <div class="header">
    <div class="logo"><span class="dot"></span>同步解析与测评</div>
    <div class="info">数学&nbsp;&nbsp;五年级&nbsp;&nbsp;下册</div>
  </div>

  <div class="title">第2课时&nbsp;&nbsp;第1课时练习课</div>

  <div class="columns">
    <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->
    <div class="col">

      <div><span class="q-num">1.</span>填一填。</div>
      <div class="indent">
        (1) $\dfrac{3}{4}+\dfrac{2}{5}=(\dfrac{2}{5}+\dfrac{3}{4})$，应用了
        <span class="red">(加法交换)</span>律。
      </div>
      <div class="indent">
        (2) $\dfrac{1}{5}+\dfrac{3}{5}+\dfrac{5}{8}=\dfrac{1}{5}+(\dfrac{3}{5}+\dfrac{5}{8})$，应用
        了<span class="red">(加法结合)</span>律。
      </div>
      <div class="indent">
        (3) $1-\dfrac{4}{15}-\dfrac{7}{15}=1-(\dfrac{4}{15}+\dfrac{7}{15})$，应用了
        <span class="red">(减法的性质)</span>。
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:10px;"><span class="q-num">2.</span>在○里填上适当的运算符号。</div>
      <div class="indent">(1) $\dfrac{3}{4}+\dfrac{4}{9}+\dfrac{5}{8}=\dfrac{5}{8}+(\dfrac{4}{9}\;\bigcirc\;\dfrac{3}{4})$</div>
      <div class="indent">(2) $\dfrac{3}{4}+\dfrac{4}{9}+\dfrac{5}{8}=\dfrac{3}{4}+(\dfrac{4}{9}\;\bigcirc\;\dfrac{5}{8})$</div>
      <div class="indent">(3) $\dfrac{8}{7}-\dfrac{4}{9}-\dfrac{5}{8}=(\dfrac{5}{8}\;\bigcirc\;\dfrac{4}{9})$</div>
      <div class="indent">(4) $\dfrac{8}{7}-\dfrac{4}{9}-\dfrac{5}{8}=\dfrac{8}{7}-(\dfrac{4}{9}\;\bigcirc\;\dfrac{5}{8})$</div>

      <div style="margin-top:10px;"><span class="q-num">3.</span>选择合适的方法进行计算。</div>

      <div class="calc-block">
        $\dfrac{3}{4}+\dfrac{1}{6}-\dfrac{5}{8}$<br>
        <span class="red">$=\dfrac{18}{24}+\dfrac{4}{24}-\dfrac{15}{24}$</span><br>
        <span class="red">$=\dfrac{7}{24}$</span>
      </div>

      <div class="calc-block">
        $\dfrac{7}{8}-(\dfrac{5}{8}-\dfrac{5}{6})$<br>
        $=\dfrac{7}{8}-\dfrac{5}{8}+\dfrac{5}{6}$<br>
        <span class="red">$=\dfrac{21}{24}-\dfrac{15}{24}+\dfrac{20}{24}$</span><br>
        <span class="red">$=\dfrac{13}{9\;?}\;(=\dfrac{9}{8})$</span>
      </div>

      <div class="calc-block">
        $1-(\dfrac{15}{30}+\dfrac{4}{30})$<br>
        <span class="red">$=1-\dfrac{16}{30}$</span><br>
        <span class="red">$=\dfrac{14}{30}=\dfrac{7}{15}$</span>
      </div>

      <div class="calc-block">
        $(\dfrac{6}{8}+\dfrac{7}{3})+(\dfrac{5}{6}-\dfrac{14}{?})$<br>
        <span class="red">$=1+(\dfrac{10}{6}-\dfrac{3}{6})$</span><br>
        <span class="red">$=1+\dfrac{7}{6}$</span><br>
        <span class="red">$=\dfrac{13}{6}$</span>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->
    <div class="col">

      <div><span class="q-num">4.</span>计算下面图形的周长。</div>

      <div class="fig-row">
        <div class="placeholder" style="width:150px;height:110px;">
          [Diagram: 三角形，边长10dm、7dm，另一边未标注]
        </div>
        <div class="placeholder" style="width:120px;height:110px;">
          [Diagram: 四边形②，边长12m、E点标注]
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="calc-block">
        ①<br>
        $\dfrac{1}{4}+\dfrac{4}{7}+\dfrac{7}{10}$<br>
        <span class="red">$=\dfrac{5}{10}+\dfrac{4}{10}+\dfrac{7}{10}$</span><br>
        <span class="red">$=\dfrac{16}{10}=1\dfrac{6}{10}(dm)$</span>
      </div>

      <div class="calc-block">
        ②<br>
        <span class="red">$\dfrac{20}{10}=2(dm)$</span>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:10px;">
        <span class="q-num">5.</span>周末，五(1)班有$\dfrac{2}{7}$的同学到郊外劳动，
        $\dfrac{2}{5}$的同学到图书馆读书，还有$\dfrac{11}{35}$的同学留
        在家中。留在家中的同学比出门的同学
        多还是少？多或少几分之几？
      </div>

      <div class="calc-block">
        <span class="red">$\dfrac{2}{7}+\dfrac{2}{5}=\dfrac{24}{35}$</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;
        <span class="red">$\dfrac{11}{35}$</span><br>
        <span class="red">$\dfrac{24}{35}-\dfrac{13}{35}=\dfrac{11}{35}$</span>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:10px;">
        <span class="q-num">6.</span>有一个装满水的水池，若第一次放出一池
        水的$\dfrac{3}{8}$，第二次放出一池水的$\dfrac{1}{4}$，第三次又
        注入一池水的$\dfrac{4}{7}$。现在池子里的水占池子
        的几分之几？
      </div>

      <div class="calc-block">
        <span class="red">$1-\dfrac{3}{8}-\dfrac{1}{4}+\dfrac{4}{7}=\dfrac{33}{56}$</span>
      </div>

      <div class="placeholder" style="width:200px;height:60px;margin-top:10px;">
        [Table: 小表格，内容不清 illegible]
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-num">72</div>
  <div class="corner-deco">✂</div>

</div>
